rtions","messageBody":"Parser dispatch and journal storage rely on internal assumptions that are not checked explicitly.\n\nViolations can cause incorrect command handling or corrupt journal records.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Add assertions for matching command keywords, journal storage, and restored completion statuses.\n* Enable assertions in tests\n","tags":["A-FullCommitMessage"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":1,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":107,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"5654945f8a6a423a438332e302671fa261ed29eb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command specific parsing from Parser","messageBody":"Parser.parse combines command dispatch, argument validation, date conversion and task constructioin in one long method.\n\nThis makes the supported commands difficult to scan and forces readers to go through unrelated rules when changing one command.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Extract find, deadline, todo and event parsing into respective private methods.\n* Add regression tests for date validation, mixed case inputs and malformed details.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":138,"deletions":61}}},{"hash":"32e95de7c1ad321c7b4ae6f84c5602215e7b63b8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Consolidate duplicate task index validation in commands","messageBody":"Mark, unmark and delete commands repeat the same index bound checks and invalid selection messages.\n\nThis risks inconsistent behaviour when validation rules or error message changes, and is a violation to the DRY principle.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Extract a shared task index validation helper in Command and use it in all three command subclasses.\n* Add regression tesst for invalid selections, successful operations and repeated commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":145,"deletions":26}}},{"hash":"2f3fa460e14b97f50b53b64de5bcfdb681386843","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Derive add command task types from their tasks","messageBody":"AddCommand constructor accpets a task and a task type.\n\nCallers can call conlicting values and produce a wrong confirmation label.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Add a getter method to each task types to derive the confirmation label from the returned category.\n* Remove the redundant constructor argument (TaskType) and update the parser\u0027s add command calls.\n* Add a regression test to verify labels and persisted tasks remain consistent.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":89,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"7b01bd56a5b17af1a9b9f721d1a409f4f72266f9","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command keyword matching in Parser","messageBody":"Duplicate keyword matching expressions in seven different branches and the length of the keyword is manually specified.\n\nThis risks inconsistent behaviour and makes future changes error prone.\n\nLet\u0027s,\n* Extract a named matching helper and calculate the length from the keyword.\n* Add regression tests to verify that the dispatch behaviour is unchanged.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":37,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"9c728e28188940a43720124dc196543275d61d9b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Use streams to format numbered task lists","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":47,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"6d532817f74bb34fb271fb95b11cc959b6cf778e","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #4 from Xuenyin/branch-A-Assertions","messageBody":"Document internal assumptions with assertions","tags":["A-Assertions"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"a195f07a8130f4a5da42686d2ffb1db59cb86036","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027master\u0027 into branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"b0d916ec0b965d0c52851ebcb3fcc4aa4ac4bb78","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #3 from Xuenyin/branch-A-CodeQuality","messageBody":"Improve code quality","tags":["A-CodeQuality"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap